lienti di invertire il processo di invecchiamento. Quando Mia va a indagare, si ritrova intrappolata, marchiata e torturata in una triste struttura sotterranea. I volti familiari iniziano ad apparire e si rende conto che non è sola in questo. Riesce in qualche modo a trovare forza interiore e fuggire dall'incubo?"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"A renowned health supplement company, run by a ruthless businesswoman, is selecting and abducting young women as part of an experiment bio-hacking babies’ DNA to enable her clients to reverse the aging process. When Mia goes to investigate, she finds herself trapped, branded and tortured in a grim underground facility. Familiar faces start to appear, and she realises that she is not alone in this. Can she somehow find inner strength and escape from the nightmare?","tagline":"Unnatural selection"},{"language":"da-DA","overview":"Den unge rytter Mia finder ud af, at et velrenommeret helsekostfirma, ejet af en målrettet forretningskvinde, er involveret i kidnapning af kvinder. Firmaet bruger kvinderne til biohacking-eksperimenter, som har til formål at give rige klienter deres ungdom tilbage. På jagt efter sandheden bliver Mia selv indfanget og brændemærket i de skumle, underjordiske faciliteter. Bekendte skikkelser dukker op, og Mia indser, at situationen er mere kompleks, end hun troede. Men kan hun genfinde sin egen indre styrke og undslippe mareridtet?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8VKsq26fe7reSHyLgCqLL5ezJgU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xqVfmPM0zm9iNX4BuWj22yZl1gX.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":718135,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"da-DA","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p4RwOjzPQ4lpA4pGll5DKXuGlr3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb